{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/316","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/316/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/316/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/316/events","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/316","id":6025108631,"node_id":"I_kwDOVFVR088AAAABZx_clw","number":316,"title":"[消息队列 MQ08] 重试与死信：失败消息，为什么不能一直重试？","user":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:44:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:41:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- message-queue-series:2026-10-25:mq08 -->\n\n**核心顺序8/9；MQ08仅作稳定题库索引。待定稿，未开拍。** 拟为独立视频及配套图文，无观看硬前置。\n\n## 独立问题与主线\n\n暂时失败值得重试，永久失败却可能一直占用处理机会：怎样停止热循环，同时保留修复入口？\n\n1. 本片自行建立RabbitMQ quorum queue、失败投递和重新入队；让同一条有eventId的消息立即重投，持续显示失败原因和无效尝试。\n2. 区分暂时不可用与永久业务拒绝，设置明确的业务重试预算和间隔；用故障恢复后成功的分支说明为什么仍要允许有限重试。\n3. 达到预算的消息进入死信处理路径，保留原因与身份；修复后受控回放，业务成功前不显示“已完成”。\n\n观众应能解释重试的收益与代价，以及死信为什么是待处置状态。本片自带ACK/重投的必要含义，不要求先看幂等片；回放仍须去重的条件会简短说明。\n\n## 专项对照验收\n\n从同一初始消息分别展示立即循环和有限重试；核对真实尝试数、等待、预算耗尽与死信归属。暂停死信目标验证所选转发保证，再恢复并回放，确认消息身份和失败原因可追踪；不得把等待、隔离或回放发出算作业务成功。\n\n## 边界与资料\n\n固定RabbitMQ版本、reject/nack等动作及重试机制。失败预算采用显式业务计数，不假定每次nack(requeue=true)都会增加delivery-count。默认DLX不自带可靠重发布保证；若承诺at-least-once死信转发，须满足quorum配置条件并验证目标不可用场景。死信也可能循环，回放仍需考虑去重与顺序，不把RabbitMQ能力套到任意KafkaConsumer。\n\n- [RabbitMQ Quorum Queues](https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/quorum-queues)：失败计数、投递限制与重试。\n- [RabbitMQ Dead Letter Exchanges](https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/dlx)：死信路径及可靠转发条件。\n- [RabbitMQ Acknowledgements and Confirms](https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/confirms)：拒绝、重新入队与确认。\n\n公共制作与验收规范统一见[总览#308](https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/308)；通用流程不在本单重复。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/316/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/316/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_u